      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a1a9f621dbaef8610884e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP已经攒满啦～！不管是怎样的训练，我都会加油努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1500dcc8f2fdba339cde0011883b1a41fb309a450cc077e96af63f0fb0f3c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f652d4a0addba4ffb27d70bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那个……听说TP已经攒满了。……我可以先开始热身吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ba22d055f1e0dca53ae11bd2732ed479c421ab4a00bc7d92d5ff6582f69c974",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddd87ebbe2a8ad4676e5cfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦！呐，已经等得够久了吧？快点训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5bc7b9a33fed32e52b0df6ee070eda0f95c3dcbd35b6d5009df5114e8eb55cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842848e7af590936539ec5bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hi♪ TP似乎完全恢复了！要不要干劲十足地开始训练呀～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77462c114c79b325db83a141bbffb420ae5680c76794abe14a9d0a8651cb12d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8d3c21dc66b2e9d78e39d48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像完全恢复了。那么，今天我们要上演怎样的“奇迹”呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e8ac7791ec354299d0c394cf5547d0871f94d402b658cee7a703f01ccbdbd3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d99c14e297aefbe634cba052",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像攒满了……剩下的……嗯，直接见面聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "221ab2ce06f6b7b1d4ac94b7237f05555b4322b740c64d21dda59d5ab4b22b34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33952ec6b6508646d836fa08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Peace Peace☆ 小金船的天气预报时间到～♪\\n明天的天气是——谁知道啊。啊，听说TP全恢复了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ecb8f43a736f1db0f2131f5584b56ffb9d07e95db11da08bb40ddb6b4845022",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d7e3fe24da6a5900022f73c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好嘞，TP全恢复！就算休息完我也超厉害的哦？\\n我会让你在练习时也看到我最强最帅的跑姿的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d3c651840988b65cf745b97a71b8cd81ce3e42b9b7a982cf923615c5af16b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26f2a5e7f3ebed0500767fb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了。总之我会先把一个人能做的\\n项目练了……你也要快点过来啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32cc554674f633c922d256010890b127a1fb05b2bbe550e142b0427412a0849e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5350693ccd3f16be32f69c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦！\\n训练尽管放马过来，嘿，欢迎光临！",
      "source_fingerprint": "207400bd9dd0f50b4c9b951acea4ee89537c93250587ac370701f0d4ea6864f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9805ede857b7b0c306a8966f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像已经完全恢复了。\\n能再次请您多多指导吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b3dd250008ae112dc48994bf156ade7e871a2af6519efe890fc3edb244693f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:549874d1986e73163d3f1898",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，训公，TP已经满了哦！\\n要训练的吧？喂，打起精神来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afe2cc054149db8a2d58012d33f569407c299916901dc393191202dc8e05a671",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0da7caf59d6084c1a441d4eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经全恢复了。\\n这样又能继续钻研磨炼了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c998d870b9bf165743f101fd14545d8425a29c53991c23c7849749daea61490e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:282bd60ad21a2c4a02520e12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像完全恢复了哒！\\n也就是说也就是说～……进入训练时间了对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7567a010aaf9789f9280735b6af96e7fb5085537b46507ea4173462a45328b2d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb4cd5ccedd2bd794bbab56",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经全部恢复了。\\n果然大家都在期待着我的表现呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5057ace0cf31416393fab1153d990407e8795146520495a219c61035ddca7087",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5ef9d33e98bf1a3b08530f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了。等待到此为止。\\n……要开始了吧，训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0799e4743302466c7ab6886f1ed23cdac17117c7dfbe833ed9785cebf610816f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efe122842c70e85ca558d4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经完全恢复了。积土成山……日日的努力，\\n都会成为我们的食粮。来，让我们开始精进技艺吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e6263351910d0fd5921c49f2d6a60376e86ef64b614e9cffa8b369b70ed3683",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a3f5a18c489b28f71d46f58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复了……汇报完毕。\\n我已经履行了职责，你也去完成你的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c513d44f98541194d7d2717bf0d9dcd89547a9a884a8407a74a2c3d80c62a6d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12ec460927e5033021c7c67c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦！来吧来吧，\\n到了赛马娘观察时间咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76264de891af8b2b401f1c28720b69bfabad8bb8dab96a347cbaf20948907e56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e02ec18d488a96e57551b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀？TP已经满了呢。\\n嘛，别急，慢～悠～地来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51589a849e5f821729632746def7503f329b3309c6c0aa52771bd01b22133e5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c21dfa4fcc9a1e800d71c56e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经攒满啦！不快点的话就要溢出来咯～！\\n——开玩笑的啦！好啦，我会稍微等一下的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d060d0e5940912963c6c116d295674e755866e3b8a7941760720eeb545cddb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
